Regularization:

this is the process to ensure we avoid our model to either come
under one of the below

1. OverFitting
2. UnderFitting

Methods to Achieve : (Either overfitting or underfitting)

1. Lasso (Column Selection) - KBest
   L1 - Chooses the best column
2. Ridge (Column Extraction) - PCA, ICA, LDA
   L2 - Combines the column with best feature insights

Both combined can help us achieving "OverFitting"
More influence of both can also lead to "UnderFitting"

Penalty:

| Penalty      | Meaning                  | Effect                                              |
| ------------ | ------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |
| `None`       | No regularization        | Model focuses only on prediction error              |
| `l1`         | Lasso Regularization     | Can make coefficients exactly 0 (feature selection) |
| `l2`         | Ridge Regularization     | Shrinks coefficients but keeps most features        |
| `elasticnet` | Combination of L1 and L2 | Both feature selection and shrinkage                |

C :

| C     | Penalty Strength         |
| ----- | ------------------------ |
| 1000  | Very weak penalty        |
| 100   | Weak penalty             |
| 10    | Mild penalty             |
| 1     | Default                  |
| 0.1   | Strong penalty           |
| 0.01  | Very strong penalty      |
| 0.001 | Extremely strong penalty |

Solver:

| Solver      | Meaning                             | Speed                   | Supports L1? |
| ----------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------ |
| `lbfgs`     | Quasi-Newton method                 | Fast                    | ❌            |
| `liblinear` | Coordinate descent                  | Good for small datasets | ✅            |
| `saga`      | Stochastic gradient descent variant | Large datasets          | ✅            |
| `sag`       | Stochastic average gradient         | Large datasets          | ❌            |
| `newton-cg` | Newton method                       | Medium                  | ❌            |
